-    /// gates existence via `take_head_plane` → `Some`. Fail-closed off the
-    /// Layerwise+MTP path, on a non-page-aligned / zero window, or with no sealed
-    /// full page — Legacy / AR-only never plan the head (byte-neutral). Returns the
